隱私權政策 / Privacy Policy
中文版
本應用程式（以下簡稱「本機器人」）非常重視您的隱私權。為了讓您安心使用本服務，請詳閱以下隱私權政策：

我們收集的資料：為了提供機器人核心功能（如指令互動、身分驗證等），本機器人可能會暫時或永久記錄必要的 Discord 相關識別資訊，包括但不限於使用者 ID (User ID)、伺服器 ID (Guild ID) 及互動指令相關的訊息內容。

資料的用途：收集到的資料僅用於維持機器人的正常運作、提供特定指令功能及防範濫用行為。我們絕不會將您的個人資料販售、出租或任意透漏給第三方。

資料安全：我們採取合理的技術與安全措施來保護所收集的資料，防止未授權的存取或洩漏。

政策修改：本隱私權政策可能隨時更新，修改後的內容將公佈於此頁面。

English Version
This application (hereinafter referred to as the "Bot") values your privacy. Please read the following Privacy Policy carefully:

Data We Collect: To provide core functionalities (such as command interactions and verification), the Bot may temporarily or permanently record necessary Discord-related identification information, including but not limited to User IDs, Guild IDs, and message content related to interactive commands.

Use of Data: The collected data is used solely to maintain the normal operation of the Bot, provide specific command features, and prevent abuse. We will never sell, rent, or disclose your personal data to third parties.

Data Security: We implement reasonable technical and security measures to protect the collected data against unauthorized access or disclosure.

Policy Modifications: This Privacy Policy may be updated at any time, and any changes will be posted on this page.
